# Dockerfile-specific ignore file (BuildKit uses it instead of the repo-root .dockerignore when
# building with -f mayhem/Dockerfile). Upstream's root .dockerignore drops .git/ and tests/, which
# the commit image needs: the full history, and tests/components/ for the C++ unit-test suite.

# ── Build outputs / local cruft ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep build artifacts out of the context — the COPY boundary is what separates
# source from artifacts. build.sh produces its outputs under /mayhem at build time.
# Adjust the patterns per project.
build/
out/
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dylib
**/__pycache__/

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
mayhem/out/
